        "client_msg_id": "85b2d3e0-140e-4320-8abf-abeb6c591420",
        "text": "it support cyclic connections. A propagator network is evaluated as a fixed-point process:\na propagator runs when a cell\u2019s knowledge is _refined_ (i.e. strictly grows), not merely when some message arrives.\n\nThere is no single global evaluation order.\nExecution proceeds by information growth until quiescence (a fixed point)\nis reached.",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1769970073.454439",
        "parent_user_id": "U08HU0GT52A",
