                                "text": "refined",
                                "style": {
                                    "italic": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " (i.e. strictly grows), not merely when some message arrives.\n\nThere is no single global evaluation order.\nExecution proceeds by information growth until quiescence (a fixed point)\nis reached."
